# S19c, member a (k2, level 7): with b through the lobby gate; fights the goburi a while, falls, then gives up
# (holds START as a capsule): it forks off alone, its copy runs the original game over to stagML11 point 0.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@90
